{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2021-12-13 16:30:00', 'title': 'U.S. AIR FORCE SELECTS LEIDOS FOR COUNTER-SMALL UNMANNED AERIAL SYSTEMS CONTRACT', 'text': "RESTON, VA., DEC. 13, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LEIDOS\xa0(NYSE: LDOS), A FORTUNE® 500 SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY LEADER, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN AWARDED A PRIME CONTRACT BY THE U.S. AIR FORCE TO SUPPORT THE SERVICE'S COUNTER-SMALL UNMANNED AERIAL SYSTEM (C-SUAS) EFFORTS."}